# The CI edge-bump classifier (.github/workflows/ci.yml, job "changes") treats a
# subset of these excludes — docs/, test/, .github/, root-level *.md — as "does
# not ship". If you change what's excluded from the image here, update that
# classifier too, or a merge that now ships could skip its staging edge roll.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.env*
.nimblebrain
.DS_Store
**/node_modules
# Each app UI's dist/ (the platform apps' and the conversations plugin's screen)
# is built inside the image, before its source tree is copied over it; a local
# build's dist/ would otherwise replace the fresh one.
src/platform/*/ui/dist
packages/*/ui/dist
# The example connector catalog is for dev and tests; the image takes NimbleBrain's
# catalog at build instead (see the Dockerfile's ADD).
src/connectors/catalog/curated/example.yaml
web/
# The theme modules are the exception: leaf TypeScript the runtime imports to
# validate and serve a tenant brand (`src/brand/`). Nothing else under web/ ships.
!web/src/theme/
web/src/theme/__tests__/
test/
docs/
*.md
!package.json
